          "start": 1434
        },
        "quote": "(3) A warning that failure to purchase the applicable permit will result in the issuance of a complaint and notice to appear and subject the owner to potential court costs.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.15.080:block:5#text",
